# 进局冒烟：从主菜单进到局内，读取画面撤下，状态读得到玩家，全程无红标
# Enter-game smoke: from the main menu into a run, loading screen dismissed, the player is readable in state, no red markers throughout
name enter_game
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
expect_state in_game=true hp>=1 area=1
screenshot in_game.png
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
check exit 0
